"P464245353" "Thanks, {VillainName}. This is just what the doctor ordered. And, as promised, here's that sword you wanted. Don't spend it all in one place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3971884708" "Bring the sword to Senator Aquila"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P107861774" "You must deliver the sword to Senator Aquila."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1802385324" "The Aquila blade? You have recovered the symbol of my family's honor? I am in your debt, {VillainName}. And I am also in debt to your patron.<br><br>Please tell Sister Airlia that I look forward to our future discussions."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P255878" "Ah yes, {VillainName}. We can only hope that the good Senator is an honest politician and stays bought after the lengths we've gone to to purchase him. And in case you wish to purchase something yourself, please take this with my thanks. When you are rested, come see me for I have one last task for you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3003335093" "Ah {VillainName}, I am glad you have returned. For there is one final task for you to perform if my plan shall see its conclusion. There is an opportunity to sway great <color orange>Imperious</color> himself. My visions have shown me how you might make yourself to be a champion of Cimerora and gain the gratitude of its deposed monarch. This will provide you with a chance to gift to him an artwork, an artwork I will prepare for the occasion.<br><br>It is not my intention to harm brave Imperious, {VillainName}, for to do that would remove Cimerora's greatest protector and leave these lands open to the depravations of Romulus and his ilk. No, my small enchantment will merely make Imperious slightly more pliable to my words and my suggestions. Such is needed if I am to guide this place through these times of trouble.<br><br>First you must go and obtain a fine and ancient urn from where it is guarded. Bring it to me and I shall work some small magics upon it. Then, you will go to the aid of Imperious in a battle I have foreseen. With your aid, he will triumph. When he gives you your accolades, you will give to him the enchanted urn and then your service to me will be done."
// AcceptString :
"P2922931070" "Help Sister Airlia ensorcell Imperious"
// SendOffString :
"P403503331" "Pray do not tarry in this task, dear {VillainName}, for I can taste victory."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P841014732" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Co-Opting the Champion</color>"

